5782
05:28:03,480 --> 05:28:03,740
Hold on.

5783
05:28:07,270 --> 05:28:08,470
That can be, like, a color of...

5784
05:28:11,980 --> 05:28:12,080
brown?

5785
05:28:12,660 --> 05:28:12,980
Brownish?

5786
05:28:14,620 --> 05:28:15,260
Something like that.

5787
05:28:15,320 --> 05:28:15,720
That's a book.

5788
05:28:16,200 --> 05:28:17,440
It's a little bit hard to see, but that's okay.

5789
05:28:18,340 --> 05:28:20,320
I just want to distinguish it for myself later.

5790
05:28:21,460 --> 05:28:22,280
Okay, that looks good.

5791
05:28:23,080 --> 05:28:23,720
Okay, people.

5792
05:28:24,660 --> 05:28:26,620
Back to this screen right here.

5793
05:28:33,010 --> 05:28:34,310
How we doing, huh?

5794
05:28:36,150 --> 05:28:36,530
Cheers.

5795
05:28:36,730 --> 05:28:38,590
I hope you're having a wonderful Sunday, everybody.

5796
05:28:48,080 --> 05:28:49,680
This was a great stream, man.

5797
05:28:49,740 --> 05:28:51,020
I had so much fun.

5798
05:28:53,900 --> 05:28:56,060
I slept and woke up and you were still playing?

5799
05:28:56,360 --> 05:28:57,320
That's right, damn it.

5800
05:28:57,340 --> 05:28:58,180
I'm a real gamer.

5801
05:29:00,060 --> 05:29:01,680
I love the Hamis thumbs up.

5802
05:29:10,540 --> 05:29:12,960
This was a bit of an impromptu, pretty long stream, I guess.

5803
05:29:13,100 --> 05:29:14,540
I wasn't planning on streaming this long.

5804
05:29:15,320 --> 05:29:16,280
I just had fun, man.

5805
05:29:16,380 --> 05:29:16,860
What can I say?

5806
05:29:19,240 --> 05:29:20,680
Completely forgot the time while watching.

5807
05:29:21,140 --> 05:29:21,300
Same.

5808
05:29:22,040 --> 05:29:23,000
Except playing, you know?

5809
05:29:23,580 --> 05:29:25,480
I also forgot the time completely.

5810
05:29:31,970 --> 05:29:35,890
Glad to see I could catch this beginning and end of this despite my sleep.

5811
05:29:36,750 --> 05:29:36,890
Nice.

5812
05:29:38,350 --> 05:29:43,090
Well, you actually did well because the very middle of this was not as entertaining, I feel like.

5813
05:29:43,210 --> 05:29:45,850
It was the end and the start that was the best of this stream.

5814
05:29:46,450 --> 05:29:48,430
So you got the best parts.

5815
05:29:50,510 --> 05:29:52,590
I did a lot of dying in the middle there.

5816
05:29:57,060 --> 05:29:59,120
It's my and Hive's birthday today.

5817
05:29:59,440 --> 05:30:00,980
Only arrived at seven hours though.

5818
05:30:01,880 --> 05:30:02,640
Is it though?

5819
05:30:03,360 --> 05:30:04,020
Is that true?

5820
05:30:05,260 --> 05:30:05,940
Is it actually?

5821
05:30:07,020 --> 05:30:07,380
Hmm.

5822
05:30:09,820 --> 05:30:10,760
Okay, I'm going to believe it.

5823
05:30:10,920 --> 05:30:11,280
Happy birthday.

5824
05:30:14,220 --> 05:30:15,520
How many times around the sun have you been?

5825
05:30:19,000 --> 05:30:19,300
Light night.

5826
05:30:19,640 --> 05:30:21,640
I'll make a list of useful emotes in this court.

5827
05:30:21,780 --> 05:30:22,500
Maybe you can add some of them.

5828
05:30:22,640 --> 05:30:23,400
Yes, awesome.

5829
05:30:23,660 --> 05:30:23,840
Please.

5830
05:30:24,540 --> 05:30:27,240
If you want to see a cool emote, suggest them there.

5831
05:30:28,580 --> 05:30:29,740
I'm going to take a look at them.

5832
05:30:33,240 --> 05:30:37,060
I think I'm probably going to split this VOD into two pieces just because it's so long.

5833
05:30:39,100 --> 05:30:39,880
And put it on YouTube.

5834
05:30:43,500 --> 05:30:45,780
This run is so lucky and you're also not using anything.

5835
05:30:45,940 --> 05:30:47,640
It's both fun and frustrating to watch.

5836
05:30:48,820 --> 05:30:49,260
I imagine.

5837
05:30:50,440 --> 05:30:52,840
I mean, I think I'm using as much as I can, of course.

5838
05:30:53,100 --> 05:30:55,620
I mean, from my perspective, I think I'm doing as good as I can, right?

5839
05:30:55,880 --> 05:30:58,140
But obviously there are still things you're going to miss.

5840
05:30:58,520 --> 05:30:59,180
And that's fine.

5841
05:31:05,460 --> 05:31:08,280
You always get lucky with those random ass spider tunnels.

5842
05:31:08,540 --> 05:31:08,980
Do I really?

5843
05:31:10,600 --> 05:31:11,280
A low-key blessing.

5844
05:31:14,500 --> 05:31:18,460
Game gave you five different ways to go up, but when you ignore them, it just gave you...

5845
05:31:18,460 --> 05:31:18,820
Wait, really?

5846
05:31:19,020 --> 05:31:20,280
I have no idea what those were.

5847
05:31:20,560 --> 05:31:21,120
Don't tell me, though.

5848
05:31:21,620 --> 05:31:25,300
I'll probably find out later and have a good laugh about it when I finally discover it.

5849
05:31:25,780 --> 05:31:26,860
That's going to be a fun time.

5850
05:31:32,770 --> 05:31:33,430
You love the low-key?

5851
05:31:33,550 --> 05:31:34,130
Man, I hate them.

5852
05:31:34,670 --> 05:31:35,510
I can't stand it.

5853
05:31:35,570 --> 05:31:37,450
When I can kill them, then I'm fine.

5854
05:31:38,330 --> 05:31:41,010
As long as I can get rid of them, then I'm cool, you know?

5855
05:31:41,350 --> 05:31:44,310
I just don't want them next to me, near me, anywhere near.

5856
05:31:46,450 --> 05:31:48,650
The game loves and hates you at the same time?

5857
05:31:49,330 --> 05:31:50,570
I believe that.

5858
05:31:53,510 --> 05:31:55,690
Are you perhaps open to doing a daily run next?

5859
05:31:56,530 --> 05:32:02,210
People have said that it may contain a bit of spoilers or some things that shouldn't be there in the game because I haven't unlocked them yet.

5860
05:32:05,150 --> 05:32:06,550
I mean, I am open to it.

5861
05:32:07,410 --> 05:32:12,230
If people think it's fine and there's not a lot of stuff that's going to be weird for me, then it's probably okay.

5862
05:32:13,490 --> 05:32:15,150
I mean, it's not going to be much different, right?

5863
05:32:15,150 --> 05:32:18,050
It's just going to be a seed that everyone else has on the same day.

5864
05:32:20,630 --> 05:32:22,490
It contains all spells, but no major spoilers.

5865
05:32:22,770 --> 05:32:23,150
Yeah, okay.

5866
05:32:24,170 --> 05:32:24,790
That could be fun.

5867
05:32:31,340 --> 05:32:32,520
There's also a Twitch integration.

5868
05:32:32,700 --> 05:32:33,300
I know about that.

5869
05:32:33,700 --> 05:32:40,220
But people have told me I shouldn't use it yet because it would detract from the beginner experience of Noiter, you know?

5870
05:32:40,720 --> 05:32:43,540
So I'm still absorbing the game as it is.

5871
05:32:44,680 --> 05:32:49,920
But I definitely want to do the integration as well as at some point.

5872
05:32:49,920 --> 05:32:52,520
And then I actually be interactive with chat as well.

5873
05:32:53,180 --> 05:32:54,560
I think both sort of need to happen.

5874
05:32:54,660 --> 05:32:55,300
I think that would be fun.

5875
05:33:02,180 --> 05:33:03,000
Should we finish the prediction?

5876
05:33:03,180 --> 05:33:04,400
It doesn't transfer to the next stream, right?

5877
05:33:04,720 --> 05:33:06,280
I don't know what prediction you have made.

5878
05:33:07,440 --> 05:33:08,420
How do I see that?

5879
05:33:09,320 --> 05:33:10,040
I mean, it's up to you.

5880
05:33:11,320 --> 05:33:12,340
Honestly, you decide that.

5881
05:33:12,460 --> 05:33:13,040
That's totally fine.

5882
05:33:26,050 --> 05:33:29,790
Okay, guys, I'm going to go now and I'm going to release another Prey video for you guys.

5883
05:33:30,870 --> 05:33:34,770
So I'm going to send you off to another Noiter streamer.

5884
05:33:34,770 --> 05:33:36,030
Let's see who's online.

5885
05:33:36,990 --> 05:33:37,990
Let's make their day, huh?

5886
05:33:38,350 --> 05:33:38,830
If we can.

5887
05:33:41,770 --> 05:33:44,330
Well, or make their next five minutes.

5888
05:33:45,610 --> 05:33:46,450
Let's see what we got.

5889
05:33:53,340 --> 05:33:58,200
There's a guy called Tango Milk who has a stream called Noiter Novice Edition.

5890
05:33:58,740 --> 05:34:01,300
I feel like that's very... I actually love seeing that.

5891
05:34:01,860 --> 05:34:05,620
I kind of want more people to play this game now, you know, because I think it's so cool.

5892
05:34:06,440 --> 05:34:07,320
I'm going to send you off.

5893
05:34:07,920 --> 05:34:09,260
I want to say thank you all for watching.

5894
05:34:09,260 --> 05:34:10,600
This was a long-ass stream.

5895
05:34:10,740 --> 05:34:11,440
I had a lot of fun.

5896
05:34:12,040 --> 05:34:12,960
I hope you did too.

5897
05:34:13,280 --> 05:34:16,440
Thanks for subscribing and following and just watching, hanging out.

5898
05:34:16,800 --> 05:34:17,700
I appreciate it.

5899
05:34:18,100 --> 05:34:20,820
Come join the Discord and check out my YouTube channel if you're new here.

5900
05:34:21,640 --> 05:34:22,380
All right, I'm off.

5901
05:34:22,720 --> 05:34:23,320
Have a good one, guys.

5902
05:34:23,560 --> 05:34:23,760
Bye-bye.
